**依据 1 · 源码核查**：[dsh-autocompact/index.ts:195-212](https://github.com/5aaee9/pi-agent-extensions/blob/8ba4f8a5d90d5091c81c9850a9b3bbb56c9f0fce/dsh-autocompact/index.ts#L195-L212)

